== Notes ==
* When used in the map in which Priory Historian Elisa can be found, the following message is shown in chat: {{quote|Bright ley energy flickers through the sand, attracted to Priory Researcher Elisa's presence on this map.}}
* When used outside of the map in which Priory Historian Elisa can be found, the following message is shown in chat: {{quote|Energy pulses weakly through the sand, suggesting Priory Researcher Elisa is in a different area of the Crystal Desert.}}

